surface":"正沖","start":303,"end":305,"person_id":"6bc_ky1_pgl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-zhang-guang:p004:m0308","surface":"張燕","start":308,"end":310,"person_id":"6i0_r5m_4s1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-zhang-guang:p004:m0337","surface":"光","start":337,"end":338,"person_id":"72h_bvx_bj5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-zhang-guang:p004:m0363","surface":"光","start":363,"end":364,"person_id":"72h_bvx_bj5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-zhang-guang","book_id":"b-jinshu-057","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-057-zhang-guang-ws2413329"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-yue:p009","text":"越專擅威權，圖為霸業，朝賢素望，選為佐吏，名將勁卒，充於己府，不臣之跡，四海所知。而公私罄乏，所在寇亂，州郡攜貳，上下崩離，禍結釁深，遂憂懼成疾。永嘉五年，薨于項。秘不發喪。以襄陽王范為大將軍，統其眾。還葬東海。石勒追及于苦縣甯平城，將軍錢端出兵距勒，戰死，軍潰。勒命焚越柩曰：「此人亂天下，吾為天下報之，故燒其骨以告天地。」於是數十萬眾，勒以騎圍而射之，相踐如山。王公士庶死者十餘萬。王彌弟璋焚其餘眾，並食之。天下歸罪於越。帝發詔貶越為縣王。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":199,"last_line":199,"raw_start":20784,"raw_end":21015,"raw_character_offsets":[20786,20787,20788,20789,20790,20791,20792,20793,20794,20795,20796,20797,20798,20799,20800,20801,20802,20803,20804,20805,20806,20807,20808,20809,20810,20811,20812,20813,20814,20815,20816,20817,20818,20819,20820,20821,20822,20823,20824,20825,20826,20827,20828,20829,20830,20831,20832,20833,20834,20835,20836,20837,20838,20839,20840,20841,20842,20843,20844,20845,20846,20847,20848,20849,20850,20851,20852,20853,20854,20855,20856,20857,20858,20864,20865,20866,20867,20870,20871,20872,20873,20874,20875,20876,20877,20878,20879,20880,20881,20882,20883,20884,20885,20886,20887,20888,20889,20890,20891,20892,20893,20894,20895,20896,20897,20898,20899,20900,20901,20902,20903,20904,20905,20906,20907,20908,20909,20910,20911,20912,20913,20914,20915,20916,20917,20918,20919,20920,20921,20922,20923,20924,20925,20926,20927,20928,20929,20930,20931,2